# Database (SQLite + Prisma)

- SQLite via Prisma for local-first apps
- Schema changes: `npm run db:push` (or migrate when ready)
- Always load root `.env` before Prisma CLI (`load-root-env.cjs`)
- Repositories own all Prisma access
- Use transactions for multi-step writes
- Unique constraints for natural keys (e.g. externalId + type)
- Index fields used in filters/sorts
- Keep a simple settings key-value model if app needs config UI
- Backup strategy: export JSON + optional GitHub push service
